{"id":1030102,"chapter_id":1030102,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"白逸","content":"你放心，这事儿我来帮你，保证不掉链子。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"speaker":"白逸","content":"哎呀，不会出岔子的，放心吧……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"speaker":"白逸","content":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈嗝，你真可爱啊局长……我没关系的……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1014,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"白逸","content":"哕————","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"你没事吧……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"白逸","content":"……我再去趟厕所……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_6"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"content":"整个行动部门都在看着小小的公厕，气氛异常尴尬。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"真的没问题吗，局长？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"content":"眼下的状况，很难概括为“没问题”。","style":2,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"整个行动部门几十号人，围在小小的公厕前。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"澈的嘴角在下意识地抽搐，而蔻蔻的脑门上已经爆出青筋。其他随行人员更是尴尬地说不出话来。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"options":["现在怎么办？"],"style":6,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102012,"trial_step":12,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"现在怎么办？","goto":13}]},{"step":13,"speaker":"澈","content":"再等下去天可要黑了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"白逸","content":"要不别……别等我了，你们先去吧……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"白逸","content":"我待会就过去……哕……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"白逸的声音从公厕里传了出来。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"speaker":"辰砂","content":"局长，我建议先派人潜入侦查。探明敌方情报后，再让主力出动。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"至于白逸，狂级禁闭者毕竟是重要的战力……侦查的时间正好可以让她休息。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"这样最后抓捕的时候她要是能恢复过来，也可以增加行动成功的把握。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"这位行动人员的意见收到了多数人的赞同。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"你略微思索了一下：MBCC的精英行动人员与辛迪加的风土环境实在是格格不入，潜入侦查的工作恐怕不太适合他们。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"这样一来，最适合的人选就在眼前了。","style":3,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"蔻蔻、澈随我先潜入。其他人在这里待命。","style":2,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"speaker":"行动人员","content":"明白。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_24"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":305,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"你们三人穿过██街——曾经辛迪加最繁华的街区之一。如今，这里的建筑久未修葺，已然掉漆。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"content":"周围的人不多，年轻人更少，多数是些上了年纪的大爷大妈。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"content":"这副破败的景象令你蹙紧了眉头。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"别太在意，白逸她经常这样。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_28"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"跟她相处久了就习惯了。总之，别对她抱有太大的期待……但也不用完全不抱期待。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"content":"……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"澈","content":"虽然打断你不太好，但局长应该没在想咱们老板的事。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"澈","content":"倒是你，好像被人盯上了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"content":"顺着澈的视线看过去，一个乘凉的大妈正伸着脖子眯着眼睛看着你们三人。蔻蔻努力地别过脸试图掩饰。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"但这一举动似乎起到了反效果，大妈好像反而确认了你们的身份，一脸惊喜地快步走了过来。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"speaker":"大妈","content":"这不是蔻蔻吗？终于回来啦？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_35"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"speaker":"大妈","content":"你这孩子，还是跟以前一样，出去也不跟我们提一嘴，可给我们担心坏了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"……我没事。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"speaker":"大妈","content":"你当然没事，谁能让你出事啊。可你不在，我们这儿可出了不少事儿。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_39"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"发生什么？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"大妈","content":"别的不说，老李家的下水道都快堵了一个月了，大家都没辙，一直在找你帮忙修呢。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"我……呃……我今天没空……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"speaker":"大妈","content":"那明天记得过去一趟，别说大妈没给你介绍生意啊。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_43"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"大妈","content":"对了，这是哪位啊？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"大妈上下打量了你两眼。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"speaker":"大妈","content":"哟吼，看着还是个当差的。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_46"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"content":"？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"content":"我看上去很像当差的吗？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"speaker":"大妈","content":"嗐，跟大妈装什么蒜呢，你是什么人大妈能看不出来？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_49"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"speaker":"大妈","content":"不过这样也好啊，早跟你说了别跟你那个老板混了。什么事情都甩手让你做，真不是什么好东西。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"speaker":"大妈","content":"这个金毛小混球也是，整天看不见人。大妈有点事你逃得比兔子还快。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_51"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"澈倒也不在意大妈的当面数落，看着天吹起了口哨。","style":3,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"speaker":"大妈","content":"听说你那老板最近还开了个什么公司，跟黑帮抢地盘。我呸，装什么有钱人，明明还欠着我店里钱呢。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"大妈","content":"现在能跟着当差的混还是最稳当啊，大妈也替你高兴。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"content":"咳咳……","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"嗯……我还有事，先走了，回见。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"speaker":"大妈","content":"哦哦好，那大妈就不耽误你办事了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"大妈","content":"别忘了老李家的下水道啊。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"……我过几天去。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"content":"摆脱了热情的大妈，走过两个拐角，一栋老旧的建筑出现在眼前——这正是你们此行的目的地，“白记实业”总部的所在地。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"在辛迪加绝大多数黑帮都被打散的今天，大楼门前站着的那几个凶神恶煞的守卫显得尤为扎眼。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"有这几个人在，不太好直接混进去。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"既然确定了地点，我可以直接通知待命的队员强攻。","style":2,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"会打草惊蛇。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"content":"的确。或者我们可以想办法解决掉这几个守卫。","style":2,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"澈","content":"倒也不用这么麻烦。我来吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"content":"你要怎么做？有把握么？","style":2,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"澈","content":"放心——我又不是白逸。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"澈走出阴影。守卫警觉地端起了枪。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"speaker":"守卫","content":"什么人？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"澈","content":"别紧张，老兄，我就是个送信的。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"守卫","content":"送信的你能摸到这儿？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"澈","content":"这不是第一次来██街么。您这是██街43号吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"speaker":"守卫","content":"是这儿没错，你来干嘛的？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"澈","content":"我老板拉了个客户。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"澈压低了声音。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"speaker":"澈","content":"您这儿货不是还有剩吗，这次来了个有钱的肥羊，据说是急用，你们可劲儿宰。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"守卫","content":"你老板是谁？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"澈","content":"豺哥，原来食肉目的，您几位应该认识的吧，前几天刚来过。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"守卫窃窃私语了几句。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"守卫","content":"豺哥啊，谁啊？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"守卫","content":"记不起来……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"speaker":"守卫","content":"名字倒是食肉目的风格……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_83"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102083,"trial_step":83},{"step":84,"speaker":"澈","content":"就是长得挺胖，喜欢穿豹纹的那个。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_84"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102084,"trial_step":84},{"step":85,"speaker":"守卫","content":"你想起来是谁了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_85"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102085,"trial_step":85},{"step":86,"speaker":"守卫","content":"没有。但听起来跟老板挺像。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102086,"trial_step":86},{"step":87,"speaker":"守卫","content":"不是一路人也不进一家门。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102087,"trial_step":87},{"step":88,"speaker":"守卫","content":"管他呢，既然说是来买货的，要不直接放进去吧……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_88"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102088,"trial_step":88},{"step":89,"speaker":"守卫","content":"你等会儿，我再问他两句。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102089,"trial_step":89},{"step":90,"speaker":"守卫","content":"咳咳，豺哥啊，我想起来了，你怎么不早说呢——他自己怎么没来？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102090,"trial_step":90},{"step":91,"speaker":"澈","content":"嗨呀别提了，昨天非要拉着人家吃饭，结果自己上吐下泻出不了门，客户啥事儿没有。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_91"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102091,"trial_step":91},{"step":92,"speaker":"澈","content":"这不只能让我这个菜鸟来了吗？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102092,"trial_step":92},{"step":93,"speaker":"守卫","content":"那你客户呢？怎么只有你一个人。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102093,"trial_step":93},{"step":94,"speaker":"澈","content":"我肯定得先给您几位爷通个信。不然万一来了进不了门，这生意不就黄了吗。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102094,"trial_step":94},{"step":95,"content":"守卫们相互看了几眼，神情慢慢缓和下来。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102095,"trial_step":95},{"step":96,"speaker":"守卫","content":"豺哥还那么爱喝，不怕喝死自己？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_96"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102096,"trial_step":96},{"step":97,"speaker":"澈","content":"您也不是不知道，豺哥就好这么一口。为了这点爱好恨不得工钱都不给我们发。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_97"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102097,"trial_step":97},{"step":98,"speaker":"澈","content":"这东西非常重要，千万别弄丢了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102098,"trial_step":98},{"step":99,"speaker":"守卫","content":"那你不早点走人？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102099,"trial_step":99},{"step":100,"speaker":"澈","content":"最近世道不好混呐，食肉目都没了……能勉强混口饭吃不错了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102100,"trial_step":100},{"step":101,"speaker":"守卫","content":"倒也是……世道不好混。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102101,"trial_step":101},{"step":102,"speaker":"守卫小弟A","content":"天下乌鸦一般黑，辛迪加能有什么好老板。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102102,"trial_step":102},{"step":103,"content":"另一个守卫插嘴道。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102103,"trial_step":103},{"step":104,"speaker":"守卫小弟A","content":"我们老板也是。不知道从哪儿搞来了狂厄武器，在这种时候还这么高调，生怕别人不知道似的。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102104,"trial_step":104},{"step":105,"speaker":"守卫小弟B","content":"就是，我天天都在怕FAC的人摸过来，觉都睡不好。要我说，这白老板肯定是个外来户……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102105,"trial_step":105},{"step":106,"speaker":"守卫小弟B","content":"要不是给钱给得多我早*文明*溜了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102106,"trial_step":106},{"step":107,"speaker":"守卫","content":"诶——","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_107"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102107,"trial_step":107},{"step":108,"content":"似乎是觉得手下的人话太多，为首的守卫打断了他们。","style":3,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102108,"trial_step":108},{"step":109,"speaker":"守卫","content":"既然是豺哥的人——你让客户过来吧。同行最多三个人，最晚明天早上提货，过时不候。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102109,"trial_step":109},{"step":110,"speaker":"澈","content":"才三个？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_110"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102110,"trial_step":110},{"step":111,"speaker":"守卫","content":"非常时期，别家眼红我们的货也不是一天两天了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102111,"trial_step":111},{"step":112,"speaker":"守卫","content":"放心，我们白记实业是正经公司，不做那些绑票勒索的活计。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102112,"trial_step":112},{"step":113,"speaker":"澈","content":"……行，我信几位老哥。我去把客户叫来。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1019,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102113,"trial_step":113},{"step":114,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"光是扯皮就让他们放人了？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102114,"trial_step":114},{"step":115,"speaker":"澈","content":"不然呢？他们是开门做生意的，怀疑这怀疑那等着破产啊？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102115,"trial_step":115},{"step":116,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"……你不会真像白逸说的那样，吃里扒外吧？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102116,"trial_step":116},{"step":117,"speaker":"澈","content":"瞎想什么呢……","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_117"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102117,"trial_step":117},{"step":118,"speaker":"澈","content":"总之就是这么个情况，人太多不给进，人少了又不保险。你自己决定吧。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_118"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102118,"trial_step":118},{"step":119,"content":"你觉得呢？","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102119,"trial_step":119},{"step":120,"speaker":"澈","content":"我？我觉得进去看看没什么。他们卖狂厄武器的，看不上绑肉票这点钱。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_120"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102120,"trial_step":120},{"step":121,"content":"蔻蔻，你呢。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102121,"trial_step":121},{"step":122,"speaker":"蔻蔻","content":"我还是那句话，直接强攻会打草惊蛇。这一带地形很乱，很容易把人放跑。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102122,"trial_step":122},{"step":123,"options":["进入大楼"],"style":6,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102123,"trial_step":123,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"进入大楼","goto":124}]},{"step":124,"content":"既然如此，我们就进去探探虚实吧。","style":2,"background":1008,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102124,"trial_step":124},{"step":125,"content":"你们三人在守卫的“陪护”下进入了大楼。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102125,"trial_step":125},{"step":126,"speaker":"守卫","content":"抱歉，我们老板有点事，待会儿才能接见你们。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102126,"trial_step":126},{"step":127,"options":["让守卫带你逛逛"],"style":6,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102127,"trial_step":127,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"让守卫带你逛逛","goto":128}]},{"step":128,"speaker":"守卫","content":"也行，你们想看什么？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102128,"trial_step":128},{"step":129,"content":"在守卫的带领下，你们参观了“白记实业”的会议室、员工宿舍和办公区，每一个地方都装修得像模像样，不比新城的一些小公司差。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102129,"trial_step":129},{"step":130,"content":"一个辛迪加卖狂厄武器的组织，居然真就把一家公司该有的东西都配备齐了。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102130,"trial_step":130},{"step":131,"speaker":"澈","content":"嚯，您这儿可真不简单，柳生的楼里都未必有您这儿齐全。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102131,"trial_step":131},{"step":132,"speaker":"守卫","content":"都是瞎折腾，要不怎么他们都说白老板是新城来的呢。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_132"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102132,"trial_step":132},{"step":133,"speaker":"守卫","content":"也就这些宝贝货真价实，别的都是摆设。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_133"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102133,"trial_step":133},{"step":134,"content":"正如守卫所说，楼里最显眼的东西，就要数成员们人手一个的狂厄武器了。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102134,"trial_step":134},{"step":135,"speaker":"守卫","content":"这里是茶水间，再往外就是会客室了。我们老板事情还没办完，要不你们先去坐会儿？","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102135,"trial_step":135},{"step":136,"content":"守卫正说着，澈给你使了个眼色。","style":3,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102136,"trial_step":136},{"step":137,"options":["洗手间在哪儿？"],"style":6,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102137,"trial_step":137,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"洗手间在哪儿？","goto":138}]},{"step":138,"speaker":"守卫","content":"厕所啊？出门右转。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102138,"trial_step":138},{"step":139,"content":"嗯，我去一趟。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102139,"trial_step":139},{"step":140,"speaker":"守卫","content":"听说你昨天把那个什么豺哥干趴下了？就这小胳膊细腿儿的，没想到挺厉害啊。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102140,"trial_step":140},{"step":141,"content":"侥幸而已……我也够呛。","style":2,"background":1045,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102141,"trial_step":141},{"step":142,"content":"在守卫赞赏的眼神中，你快步走入了洗手间。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102142,"trial_step":142},{"step":143,"content":"暂时摆脱了守卫的盯梢，你总算觉得轻松了些，对着洗手台的镜子擦了擦额边的汗。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102143,"trial_step":143},{"step":144,"speaker":"澈","content":"没想到他们有这么多狂厄武器，不太好办啊。你的人想攻下这里恐怕不太够。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102145,"trial_step":145},{"step":145,"content":"在“参观”途中你也看到了，这里的守卫恨不得每个人都配备了狂厄武器。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102146,"trial_step":146},{"step":146,"content":"哪怕是在前几个月，这种狂厄武器配备率都是相当惊人的程度。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102147,"trial_step":147},{"step":147,"content":"的确……","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102148,"trial_step":148},{"step":148,"content":"稳妥一点，最好先按兵不动。改天多派几个禁闭者来处理。","style":2,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":130102149,"trial_step":149},{"step":149,"speaker":"澈","content":"这样也挺好。要不是提前侦查，损失可就大了。","voice":["vo_trial_30102_1_150"],"voice_bank"